summary:
  The player's stopped edge wipes the header over a return to live.

history:
  The engine's keep is only worth something if the line that clears the
  header asks for it. This is that line, as it stood before 2026-09-21.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
                  if (!root._tsPaused && !timeshift.shifted && !timeshift.sleeveKept(Date.now())) root.metadata = "";

replace:
                  if (!root._tsPaused && !timeshift.shifted) root.metadata = "";

expect:
  Killed by test_invariants::test_a_return_to_live_keeps_the_header_until_live_speaks.
  Line-neutral.
